Answer::escaped scans a std::string_view of 1 to 32 bytes with copied_view: up to 16 bytes through a zero padded local
std::array<char, 16> and one 16-byte load; 17 to 32 bytes through two overlapping loads. No mark means one copy.
AVX2 only (marks16_of); other targets use the scalar form copied_view_scalar. The NEON form is not written: no test has run it.
PROVISIONAL: the names copied_view and copied_view_scalar.
